  "goodToKnow": "Die Historie is a formal or slightly old-fashioned word for history: die Historie eines Hauses, eine lange Historie. In everyday German, history is die Geschichte, which also means story. In software, die Historie (or der Verlauf) is the history of actions or visited pages. Historisch means historic or historical: ein historischer Moment. Stress: his-TOH-ri-e, four syllables. Plural: die Historien."
